+| x64 | 1.0 | 534.0 | 11.7 | +4460.4% | 956.9 | 965.8 | -0.9% | 45.8 | 38.4 | +19.4% |
+| x64 | 2.0 | 683.9 | 7.8 | +8721.7% | 958.3 | 954.8 | +0.4% | 47.8 | 36.8 | +30.1% |
